{"seq":18,"slug":"fullstack-architecture","title":"全栈架构实战","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture","rating":{"composite":4,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.62,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introMarkdown":"# 全栈架构实战 简介\n\n全栈架构实战聚焦于跨越前后端边界的系统性架构决策，帮助工程师在真实项目中做出合理的技术选型与演进规划。2026 年的全栈开发已远非简单的前端加后端——它涵盖 API 层设计、服务拆分策略、部署发布工程与端到端可观测性，要求工程师具备从用户界面到基础设施的全链路视野。\n\n本 Hub 面向具备一定开发经验的中高级工程师，尤其适合正在主导或参与系统架构演进的技术负责人。内容不停留在理论层面，而是围绕真实场景中的决策权衡展开，提供可落地的参考框架。\n\n**第一章「架构模式」** 从分层架构的基本原则出发，深入探讨 BFF 模式与 API Gateway 的设计取舍，以及单体与微服务之间的决策框架。\n\n**第二章「API 设计与集成」** 对比 RESTful、GraphQL、gRPC 等不同范式的适用边界，讨论 API 版本管理的演进策略，并分析 WebSocket、SSE 等实时通信架构的选型依据。\n\n**第三章「迁移策略」** 聚焦从单体到微服务的渐进式迁移路径，包括绞杀者模式的落地细节、数据库拆分中的数据一致性挑战，以及前端从 SPA 向微前端的演进实践。\n\n**第四章「全栈运维」** 从运维视角审视全栈系统，覆盖可观测性体系设计、蓝绿与金丝雀部署策略、以及贯穿前后端的性能优化方法论。\n\n建议按章节顺序学习，先建立架构认知框架，再深入具体的 API 设计与迁移实践，最后掌握运维保障体系。每章内容相对独立，也可根据当前项目需要选择性阅读。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"architecture-patterns","title":"架构模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/architecture-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"layered-architecture","title":"分层架构与关注点分离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/architecture-patterns/layered-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bff-api-gateway","title":"BFF 模式与 API Gateway 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/architecture-patterns/bff-api-gateway"},{"seq":3,"slug":"monolith-vs-microservices","title":"Monolith 与微服务决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/architecture-patterns/monolith-vs-microservices"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"api-design-integration","title":"API 设计与集成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/api-design-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rest-vs-graphql","title":"RESTful 与 GraphQL 架构选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/api-design-integration/rest-vs-graphql"},{"seq":2,"slug":"api-versioning","title":"API 版本管理与演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/api-design-integration/api-versioning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"realtime-communication","title":"实时通信架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/api-design-integration/realtime-communication"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-strategies","title":"迁移策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/migration-strategies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"monolith-to-microservices","title":"Monolith 到微服务迁移路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/migration-strategies/monolith-to-microservices"},{"seq":2,"slug":"database-splitting","title":"数据库拆分与数据迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/migration-strategies/database-splitting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"frontend-migration","title":"渐进式前端架构迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/migration-strategies/frontend-migration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"fullstack-operations","title":"全栈运维","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/fullstack-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"observability-design","title":"全栈可观测性设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/fullstack-operations/observability-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"deployment-strategies","title":"部署策略与发布工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/fullstack-operations/deployment-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-optimization","title":"全栈性能优化体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/fullstack-operations/performance-optimization"}]}]}